### 5.1 Subnet Group Configuration

**Production Subnet Group**:

```json
{
    "CacheSubnetGroupName": "fusion-redis-subnet-group",
    "CacheSubnetGroupDescription": "Fusion Redis private subnets",
    "VpcId": "vpc-12345678",
    "Subnets": [
        {
            "SubnetIdentifier": "subnet-redis-1a",
            "SubnetAvailabilityZone": {
                "Name": "us-east-1a"
            }
        },
        {
            "SubnetIdentifier": "subnet-redis-1b",
            "SubnetAvailabilityZone": {
                "Name": "us-east-1b"
            }
        },
        {
            "SubnetIdentifier": "subnet-redis-1c",
            "SubnetAvailabilityZone": {
                "Name": "us-east-1c"
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

**Subnet Requirements**:

- **Network**: Private subnets only
- **Availability Zones**: Minimum 2, recommended 3
- **CIDR**: /24 minimum per subnet
- **Route Tables**: No internet gateway routes

