### 8.1 Security Groups

**Redis Security Group Rules**:

```json
{
    "GroupName": "fusion-redis-sg",
    "GroupDescription": "Fusion Redis cluster security group",
    "VpcId": "vpc-12345678",
    "SecurityGroupRules": [
        {
            "IpPermissions": [
                {
                    "IpProtocol": "tcp",
                    "FromPort": 6379,
                    "ToPort": 6379,
                    "UserIdGroupPairs": [
                        {
                            "GroupId": "sg-eks-worker-nodes",
                            "Description": "EKS worker nodes access"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
```
